		{
			description: [
				"Performance monitor monitors delays caused by all machines"
				""
				"You can enter /forge tps to check the game lag. It's best to make sure the tps is always at 20"
				""
				"The following things could be the cause of the delay:"
				""
				"Build everything in a small space. This will not affect the tps, but it will cause the fps to drop."
				""
				"Input and output buses are widely used in the network. It is recommended to use the ME interface."
				""
				"Place multiple orders for small quantities of items to be shipped. It is recommended to reduce the number of CPU parallels and expand the multiple model."
